# Design System

## Color Tokens (use CSS variables, never raw hex in components)
| Variable | Value | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--crm-primary` | `#0F172A` Navy | Sidebar bg, heavy text, CTAs |
| `--crm-accent` | `#6366F1` Indigo | Primary buttons, active states, links |
| `--crm-accent-hover` | `#4F46E5` | Button hover |
| `--crm-surface` | `#FFFFFF` | Card & panel backgrounds |
| `--crm-bg` | `#F8FAFC` Gray 50 | App background |
| `--crm-border` | `#E2E8F0` Gray 200 | Dividers, input borders |
| `--crm-success` | `#059669` Green | Won, Active |
| `--crm-warning` | `#D97706` Amber | In Progress, Pending |
| `--crm-error` | `#DC2626` Red | Lost, Error states |
| `--crm-text-primary` | `#0F172A` | Body headings |
| `--crm-text-muted` | `#475569` Gray 600 | Secondary text, labels |

## Spacing
- Base unit: 4px (Tailwind default). Use multiples: 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64
- Sidebar: 256px (collapsed: 64px) | TopNav: 56px
- Content max-width: 1280px, horizontal padding 24px
- Card padding: 24px | Section gap: 24px | Inline gap: 8–12px

## Button Variants (cva pattern)
| Variant | Usage |
|---|---|
| `default` | Filled indigo — primary actions (Save, Create, Submit) |
| `secondary` | Outlined — secondary actions (Cancel, Back) |
| `ghost` | No border — tertiary actions (Edit icon, kebab menu) |
| `destructive` | Red fill — destructive confirms (Delete, Revoke) |
| `loading` | Spinner + disabled — during inflight mutation |

## Status Badges
| Status | Color |
|---|---|
| New | Gray |
| Contacted | Blue |
| Qualified | Indigo |
| Won / Active | Green (`--crm-success`) |
| Lost / Error | Red (`--crm-error`) |
| In Progress / Pending | Amber (`--crm-warning`) |

## Responsive Breakpoints (test at all three)
- Mobile: 375px
- Tablet: 768px  
- Desktop: 1280px

## Component Standards
- All modals/sheets use shadcn Sheet (slide-over) for create/edit flows
- DataTable: always use `@tanstack/react-table` — never a custom table
- Toast: `react-hot-toast` — success on mutation, error on failure
- Empty state: use shared `EmptyState` component with contextual CTA
- Loading rows: **skeleton rows** (not a spinner) to prevent layout shift
